5. REAL ACTION-GATE ENFORCEMENT

The customer must be able to connect an actual agent.

Implement the complete request path:

Customer agent
→ CCK SDK
→ Authenticated CCK API
→ Authoritative Action Gate
→ Fact/evidence/dependency verification
→ Actual verdict
→ Protected tool execution or block
→ Persistent audit and receipt.

An agent must not be able to execute the protected action after BLOCK.

REVALIDATE and REQUIRE_APPROVAL must have real documented behavior.

If CCK is unavailable, the protected action must not silently proceed.

Avoid relying on the language model voluntarily calling an extra tool.

Wrap or intercept the actual protected tool execution.

