Do not simply compare marketing claims.

Run the same representative CCK workload against the selected architecture where possible.

Preferred initial direction

Prefer Google AI Studio Starter Tier for the first hosted developer preview if:

- The actual TypeScript backend can securely host the CCK gate.
- Existing Python behavior is verified against the same contracts.
- Firebase Auth and Firestore can support the data model.
- The account is eligible.
- Deployment requires no paid resources.

If these conditions do not hold, document why and evaluate Cloudflare Python Workers as the alternative.

Do not run two independent production databases.

Do not create paid resources or add billing details.

Do not migrate or delete customer data without authorization.

